{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/896090-quick-question-rokea-book","id":896090,"title":"Quick question, Rokea book","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-22T08:10:54-07:00","id":896090,"title":"Quick question, Rokea book","content":"I have blood dimmed tides, but i noticed on drive thru there's a Rokea standalone book in the same style as Bastet, etc. <br /> <br /> Does the standalone book expand/ improve on them enough to be worth my $20 (four Starbucks coffees) or would it be almost the same stuff i already have in BDT?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-22T09:23:45-07:00","id":896111,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure as I own neither, but my experience tends to be if you're into it, it's worth it. I have both versions of dark ages werewolf and they're both different enough to warrant it, and the first to second edition tribe books are different enough to warrant a buy as well. I do believe the rokea book is second edition yeah?<br /> <br /> Also hold the hammer high.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/me